## The decompiled source

The C under src/, and the symbol tables, split descriptions and linker scripts
under versions/, describe the code of a commercial game. They are a
reconstruction of work owned by its rights holders. This project does not own
that code, does not license it, and is in no way affiliated with, authorised by
or endorsed by any of the parties who made or published the game.

No game content is distributed here. This repository contains no ROM image, no
executable code from the cartridge, no assets, and no copyrighted data extracted
from it. Building requires a cartridge image you supplied yourself, and the
build verifies it by digest and refuses anything else.

The decompiled source is published for interoperability, preservation and study.
If you build from it, you are responsible for holding the rights to the
cartridge image you supply.
